---
description: Never nest a card inside a card, modal, or drawer.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No nested cards

Never place a card inside another card-like surface.

Card-like surfaces include: `bg-card` + `shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]`, `rounded-md` panels with their own shadow, `Modal`, `Drawer`, and `DockedPanel`.

## Do

- Put fields, lists, and captions directly on the parent surface.
- Use dividers, spacing, and typography for hierarchy.
- Use a **caption card** only as the outer unit, never inside a modal/drawer/card.

## Do not

```tsx
<Modal>
  <div className="rounded-md bg-card shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]">
    {children}
  </div>
</Modal>
```

```tsx
<div className="rounded-md bg-card shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]">
  <div className="rounded-md bg-card shadow-[var(--shadow-card)]">
    {children}
  </div>
</div>
```
